  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Brazil&#x2019;s Development Impact in Low Income Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It aims to increase the impact of Brazil&#x2019;s development cooperation in low income countries through financing triangular cooperation projects in social and governance sectors and uptake of evidence-based policy into national development practices in Africa. This will benefit some of the poorest African countries (up to 5 by 2016) by promoting successful Brazilian development policies and contributing to the achievement of several Global Goals within the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.</narrative>
  </description>
